tech=f'''<section class="page-intro wrap"><h1>AI and chemistry<br>for polymer discovery.</h1><p class="page-lead">Synboli combines artificial intelligence and patented chemistry to accelerate the development of high-performance materials.</p></section><section class="tech-opening wrap"><div class="tech-opening-photo">{img('material-film','Fine folds and surface detail in a polymer film',eager=True)}</div><div class="tech-opening-copy"><h2>New polymer<br>structures.</h2><p>A polymer’s structure shapes how it performs. Synboli brings together AI-guided discovery and patented synthesis to explore new structures for the properties an application requires.</p><p>Prediction narrows the search. Physical samples make it possible to evaluate what those structures can do. The two work together through successive development cycles.</p></div></section><section class="tech-pair wrap"><article><h2>Computational discovery</h2><p>Application-specific databases combine proprietary synthesis data with trusted third-party sources. Specialised models predict polymer properties and guide candidate selection around your requirements.</p></article><article><h2>Patented polymer synthesis</h2><p>Proprietary chemistry accelerates sample production and testing while giving access to new structures. Laboratory and client evaluation provide the experimental information for the next iteration.</p></article></section><section class="discovery-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-top"><h2>From data<br>to production.</h2></div><div class="process-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Discovery process"><button type="button" id="process-tab-0" role="tab" aria-controls="process-panel-0" aria-selected="true">High-quality data</button><button type="button" id="process-tab-1" role="tab" aria-controls="process-panel-1" aria-selected="false">AI discovery</button><button type="button" id="process-tab-2" role="tab" aria-controls="process-panel-2" aria-selected="false">Sample production</button><button type="button" id="process-tab-3" role="tab" aria-controls="process-panel-3" aria-selected="false">Industrial scale-up</button></div><div class="process-panels"><article class="process-panel" id="process-panel-0"><h3>High-quality data</h3><p>High-quality databases bring together data generated through Synboli’s chemistry and trusted external sources, with a focus on the application being developed.</p></article><article class="process-panel" id="process-panel-1"><h3>AI discovery</h3><p>Specialised models predict properties and identify promising candidates. Development begins with structures selected around the material’s required performance.</p></article><article class="process-panel" id="process-panel-2"><h3>Sample production</h3><p>Synboli produces laboratory samples for testing and client validation. Results help refine the models and guide further synthesis.</p></article><article class="process-panel" id="process-panel-3"><h3>Industrial scale-up</h3><p>Specialist partners support the transition from laboratory candidates to industrial trials and commercial production.</p></article></div><div class="feedback-line"><span>Testing informs the next prediction and synthesis cycle.</span></div></div></section><section class="scale-section wrap"><h2>Flexible development<br>solutions.</h2><div><p>A focused sample project, an iterative development programme or a wider application exploration can use the same combination of data, prediction and experimental chemistry.</p>{link('Explore services','/services/')}</div></section>'''
